# Installed as .typo3-update/.gitignore
#
# Keep the audit trail, drop the bulk. The documents, reports, manifests and checksums
# are small and are the evidence; the PNGs are large, numerous, and reproducible from a
# sealed baseline plus a recorded command. MANIFEST.sha256 still proves what the images
# were, so the evidence chain survives even where the images are not committed.

**/artifacts/
baseline/**/shots/
baseline/**/dom/

# Never commit these.
*.sql
*.sql.gz
.env
.env.*
*secret*
*credentials*

!.gitignore
!**/*.md
!**/*.json
!**/*.yml
!**/SHA256SUMS
!**/MANIFEST.sha256
